**Task J3 -- Visual paragraph chunking in `renderText()` (chat.js)**

File: `C:\Users\User\comfyui-agent\ui\web\js\chat.js`, line 68-72

Added a conditional class `sd-para-long` to any paragraph element where the trimmed text exceeds 200 characters. This gives the CSS layer a hook to apply extra margin or other visual treatment to long paragraphs, improving scanability of agent responses.

