**Task J4 -- Aria labels for accessibility (sidebar.js)**

File: `C:\Users\User\comfyui-agent\ui\web\js\sidebar.js`, lines 125 and 138

Two changes in the `buildSidebar()` HTML template:

1. The messages container now has `role="log"`, `aria-live="polite"`, and `aria-label="Chat with Super Duper AI"` -- allowing screen readers to announce new messages as they arrive and identify the chat region.

2. The send button now has `aria-label="Send message"` -- providing a clear accessible name for the button action.
